  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 760276,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1950s Lawn Mower Kids: A Nintendo 3DS Adventure\n\nStep back in time to the idyllic, yet surprisingly perilous, world of 1950s suburbia in *1950s Lawn Mower Kids*!  When a mischievous gremlin infestation threatens to overrun Pleasantville, it's up to a group of resourceful kids – armed with vintage lawn mowers – to save the day. \n\nThis charming action-puzzle game blends fast-paced mowing mechanics with clever problem-solving.  Players navigate vibrant, hand-painted levels, carefully trimming grass to uncover hidden pathways, activate ancient sprinkler systems, and ultimately, trap the gremlins.  Utilize your lawn mower's unique attachments – from a leaf blower for clearing obstacles to a fertilizer sprayer for boosting speed – to overcome challenges. \n\nFeaturing a quirky cast of characters, a catchy 1950s soundtrack, and a heartwarming story about friendship and community, *1950s Lawn Mower Kids* offers a unique and delightful experience for players of all ages.  Master the art of lawn care and become the heroes Pleasantville deserves!  3D effects enhance the visual charm and add depth to the mowing action."
    },
